    },
    {
      "id": "claim_ecb400905ce146c4b0fb9b9a0e9c642e",
      "statement": "The debugger attach checks whether an existing connection is still healthy and leaves it alone if so, because PyCharm clears the global debugger when its debug-server socket closes and Unity domain reloads would otherwise thrash it; failures back off on a retry timer rather than flooding the console, since a debug server is normally absent outside a debugging session.",
      "evidence": [
