      "statement": "debugging/test_server.py is the only written record of the ZeroMQ wire schema — four per-joint arrays plus two contact booleans on port 5555 — but its request side has drifted: it expects a bare frame number while the C# client sends a JSON object, so against the current client it would reply with an error object every tick.",
